        "tag": "MAIN",
        "classes": "flex-1 flex flex-col relative w-full pt-14 pb-safe bg-surface",
        "text": "全部\n      \n\n        活动提醒\n        2\n\n\n        互动消息\n      \n\n        系统通知\n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nalarm\n\n\n\n周六晚场羽毛球 即将开始\n10分钟前\n\n\n            距离活动开始还有 2 小时，地点在静安体育中心 3号馆，别忘记带运动拍！\n          \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nconfirmation_number\n          查看入场凭证\n        \n\nnear_me\n          导航前往\n        \n\n\n\n\n\n\nbolt\n\n\n\n周五桌游局 有 2 位新球友申请\n35分钟前\n\n\nAlex 与 Momo 申请加入您的活动，请尽快确认名额～\n          \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n+2 人待审核\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          查看详情\n        \n\n          一键通过\n        \n\n\n\n\n\nfmd_bad\n\n\n\n滨江日落·城市漫步 集合点更新\n2小时前\n\n\n          主办人 Luna 更新了集合点：徐汇滨江海事塔长椅旁，请准时赴约。\n        \n\nlocation_on\n          点击查看新定位与路线\n        \n\n\n\n\n\ncheck_circle\n\n\n\n创业者咖啡局 已达成成局条件！🎉\n昨天\n\n\n          已满 6 人，活动已正式锁定。AI 伙伴已为您同步群日程，期待明天碰面！\n        \n\n\n\n\n群专属临时交流室已开启\n\nchevron_right\n\n\n\n\n\n\naccount_balance_wallet\n\n\n\n上周剧本杀活动 费用明细已生成\n2天前\n\n\n          主办方已发起费用分摊，人均 ¥45.00，请及时核对与支付。\n        \n\n\n            去结算\n          \n\n            费用清单\n          \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      Stay in the loop. Never miss a game.\n    \n\n      AI-Powered IRL Social Gatherings\n    \n\n\n\n  // Interactive Pill Tab Switcher\n  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('#tab-group .tab-btn');\n  tabs.forEach(tab => {\n    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      tabs.forEach(t => {\n        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');\n        t.classList.remove('bg-primary-container', 'text-on-primary', 'shadow-sm', 'shadow-primary/20');\n        t.classList.add('bg-surface-container-high', 'text-on-surface-variant');\n      });\n      tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');\n      tab.classList.remove('bg-surface-container-high', 'text-on-surface-variant');\n      tab.classList.add('bg-primary-container', 'text-on-primary', 'shadow-sm', 'shadow-primary/20');\n    });\n  });",
